    "type": "game",
    "name": "Non-Virtual Reality Games",
    "steam_appid": 2449320,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience VR like never before. Without the headset!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collection of non-virtual, reality games!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > All games are played in the real world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > All necessary information is conveyed through controller vibration and sound!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play locally with your friends. Each using one controller</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Wide variety of games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How To Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your VR headset to the side, where its still visible to the trackers. Then turn up your volume, so you can hear the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally give each player one of the controllers. Now you are ready to go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 2 games included in our collection:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I Packed my Universe (2 Players, Versus)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fresh take on the classic <i>I Packed my Suitcase</i> game. Place planets freely in your room and keep track of their positions. Because you can only add a new one after confirming the positions of each previously placed planet.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghost Hunter (2 Players, Coop)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free your room of spooky creatures in <strong>Ghost Hunter</strong>! Use the virbations of the controllers to track their location and pull them apart!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supported Hardware</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are currently only supporting Valve Index and HTC Vive systems, as these have external base stations for tracking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contact</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have further questions or want to show our game at your event? Let's get in touch! <strong><a href=\"mailto:nonvr.games@gmail.com\">nonvr.games@gmail.com</a></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project was created as part of the the Games Master study program at the HAW Hamburg University Of Applied Sciences.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience VR like never before. Without the headset!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collection of non-virtual, reality games!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > All games are played in the real world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > All necessary information is conveyed through controller vibration and sound!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Play locally with your friends. Each using one controller</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Wide variety of games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How To Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your VR headset to the side, where its still visible to the trackers. Then turn up your volume, so you can hear the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally give each player one of the controllers. Now you are ready to go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 2 games included in our collection:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I Packed my Universe (2 Players, Versus)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fresh take on the classic <i>I Packed my Suitcase</i> game. Place planets freely in your room and keep track of their positions. Because you can only add a new one after confirming the positions of each previously placed planet.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghost Hunter (2 Players, Coop)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free your room of spooky creatures in <strong>Ghost Hunter</strong>! Use the virbations of the controllers to track their location and pull them apart!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supported Hardware</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are currently only supporting Valve Index and HTC Vive systems, as these have external base stations for tracking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contact</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have further questions or want to show our game at your event? Let's get in touch! <strong><a href=\"mailto:nonvr.games@gmail.com\">nonvr.games@gmail.com</a></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project was created as part of the the Games Master study program at the HAW Hamburg University Of Applied Sciences.</p>",
    "short_description": "VR without the headset! Games you only play with the VR controllers, no headset needed! Instead of visuals, these games only use vibrations and sound to convey the game, while you play in the real world!",
